Upstream dataset material
-------------------------
Question text, source annotations, captions, and other material originating
from upstream datasets are excluded from the QIMG-7 CC BY 4.0 grant and retain
their applicable source licenses. In particular, AlpacaFact is derived from
the AlpacaFarm dataset, which is licensed CC BY-NC 4.0. Consequently, the
complete QIMG-7 dataset bundle must not be represented as wholly CC BY 4.0 or
as permitting unrestricted commercial reuse. See LICENSE-DATA for details.

Images
------
Original source images and polluted or otherwise modified versions of those
images are excluded from the QIMG-7 CC BY 4.0 grant. They remain subject to
the copyrights, licenses, terms, and other rights of their respective sources,
as identified where available by original_image_url. Public availability does
not imply permission for reuse.

Archive-level metadata
----------------------
If a distribution platform requires one license identifier for the complete
archive, use CC BY-NC 4.0 as the conservative package-level identifier and
retain this notice. That identifier does not relicense or override excluded
third-party material.

This notice clarifies the scope of the repository's licenses. It does not
revoke licenses already granted for earlier versions.
